**Asymptotic Expansions**

**19.7. Expressions in Terms of Airy Functions**

When \(a\) is large and negative, write, for \(0\leq x<\infty\)

\[x=2\sqrt{|a|}\xi\qquad t=(4|a|)^{t}\]

**19.7.1**: \(\tau=-({\frac{3}{2}}\vartheta_{3})!\)

\[\vartheta_{3}={\frac{1}{2}}{\int_{\xi}}^{\xi}\sqrt{1-s}\vartheta_{3}={ \frac{1}{4}}\;{\rm arccos}\;\xi-{\frac{1}{4}}\xi\sqrt{1-k}^{2}\quad(\xi \leq 1)\]

**19.7.2**: \(\tau=+({\frac{3}{2}}\vartheta_{2})!\)

\[\vartheta_{2}={\frac{i}{2}}{\int_{1}}^{\xi}\sqrt{s^{2}-1}ds={\frac{i}{4}}\xi \sqrt{s^{2}-1}-{\frac{1}{2}}\;{\rm arccosh}\;\xi\quad(\xi\geq 1)\]

Then for \(x\geq 0\), \(a\to-\infty\)

**19.7.3**: \(U(a,\,x)\sim 2^{-{\frac{i}{2}}\iota\Gamma}\;({\frac{i}{4}}-{\frac{1}{2}}a)\; \Big{(}{\frac{t}{\xi^{2}-1}}\Big{)}^{{\frac{1}{4}}}{\rm Ai}(t)\)__
**19.7.4**: \(\Gamma\;({\frac{i}{4}}-a)\,V(a,\,x)\sim 2^{-{\frac{i}{2}}-{\frac{i}{2}}\iota\Gamma}\;({\frac{i}{4}}-{\frac{1}{2}}a)\; \Big{(}{\frac{t}{\xi^{2}-1}}\Big{)}^{{\frac{1}{4}}}{\rm Bi}(t)\)__

